WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,000
The fire is out again

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,760
Sister Weiwei, the firewood is all wet

3
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,760
Stop it

4
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,760
I have no ears

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,000
Sister Zhao Ya, I’m cold

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,320
Hold your knees and don't move them

7
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:12,240
It'll be fine tomorrow

8
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:19,980
Shi Yin Thank you for what?

9
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,520
We have prepared this grass during the day.

10
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,080
You have already prepared the grass

11
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:26,240
Just say it now

12
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,270
Su Weiwei said there was no need to prepare

13
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:29,790
We are ready for her

14
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:31,780
Now she's sitting here catching the rain

15
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,220
What else do you want to say?

16
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,020
That's enough. Shut up.

17
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:53,580
Save your energy, don’t cry when the rain pavilion doesn’t know how to do it, you see

18
00:00:56,740 --> 00:00:59,100
Why hasn't her fire been put out?

19
00:01:00,340 --> 00:01:08,320
Sister Weiwei, if you want to sleep, shut up and don’t look, just let me sleep.

20
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:15,550
The longer it rains

21
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:19,860
The clearer they are

22
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,140
Who has the final say on this island?
